</section>
<section id="S3" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">III </span><span id="S3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">MACO Methodology</span></h2>

<div id="S3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section introduces our proposed MACO framework.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.F2" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.13557v1/images_agent/LLM4CGRA_Flow_7.png" id="S3.F2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/167;" width="381" height="167" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 2</span>: </span><span id="S3.F2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center" style="font-size:90%;">An Overview of the MACO Framework for CGRA Design.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<section id="S3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S3.SS1.4" class="ltx_text">III-A</span> </span><span id="S3.SS1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Overview of the MACO Framework</span></h3>

<div id="S3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As shown in Figure 2, our framework, MACO, consists of four stages, in which CGRA HW/SW co-design, verification and correction, best design selection, and evaluation are carried out sequentially. Each stage is managed by a dedicated agent that performs its specific task while collaborating with the other agents to complete the overall CGRA design.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="S3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stage 1: CGRA Design</span> – The CGRA co-designer, guided by historical data and HW/SW co-design principles, generates multiple candidate CGRA designs.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stage 2: Validation &amp; Correction</span> – Using CGRA design tools<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib26" title="" class="ltx_ref">26</a>]</cite>, MapFixer validates compilation and structural correctness. Invalid designs are automatically repaired through iterative, report-driven feedback.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stage 3: Multi-Judge Selection</span> – A hierarchical judging system performs coarse-to-fine filtering. The coarse-grained judge uses reasoning and prior knowledge to eliminate weak candidates, producing the top K designs from the verified candidates. The fine-grained judge, potentially in combination with synthesis tools and experimental metrics (e.g., performance, power, area), selects the best design from these top K candidates.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stage 4: Performance Evaluation &amp; Feedback</span> – The final designs undergo comprehensive performance profiling using synthesis tools, and the results are stored as historical data to guide subsequent iterations.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Together, these four stages establish a closed-loop iterative design process that reduces manual intervention and significantly accelerates CGRA optimization.</p>
</div>
<figure id="algorithm1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>Adaptive Confidence CGRA Design Selection with LLM Self-Learning</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm1.5" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm1.5.1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.5.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"><span id="algorithm1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span><span id="algorithm1.5.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">k_designs</span><span id="algorithm1.5.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">: a set of K candidate designs; 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="algorithm1.5.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">Conf_Threshold</span>: confidence threshold for llm-tool switching; 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="algorithm1.5.1.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">Validation_Interval</span>: mandatory tool validation interval; 
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="algorithm1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{\alpha}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math>: Exponential Moving Average(EMA) factor</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.5.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.5.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"><span id="algorithm1.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> </span><span id="algorithm1.5.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">final_choices</span><span id="algorithm1.5.2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">: sequence of selected designs with confidence trace</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.5.3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.5.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">1</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm1.5.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Init:</span><span id="algorithm1.5.3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.5.3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">conf</span><span id="algorithm1.5.3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> = 0, </span><span id="algorithm1.5.3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">iteration</span><span id="algorithm1.5.3.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> = 0, </span><span id="algorithm1.5.3.8" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">final_choices</span><span id="algorithm1.5.3.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="algorithm1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=[\,]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" rspace="0.120em">[</mo><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=[\,]</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.5.4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.5.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">2</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm1.5.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">while</span><span id="algorithm1.5.4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><em id="algorithm1.5.4.4" class="ltx_emph" style="font-size:90%;">iterations not done</em><span id="algorithm1.5.4.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.5.4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.5.5" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.5.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.5.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.5.5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">3</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm1.5.5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">iteration</span><span id="algorithm1.5.5.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="algorithm1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.5.5.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.5.5.7" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">iteration</span><span id="algorithm1.5.5.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> + 1</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.5.6" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.5.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.5.6.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.5.6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">4</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm1.5.6.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">if</span><span id="algorithm1.5.6.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><em id="algorithm1.5.6.6" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;"><span id="algorithm1.5.6.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">conf</span> <math id="algorithm1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.5.6.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">Conf_Threshold</span> <span id="algorithm1.5.6.6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">or</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="algorithm1.5.6.6.4" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">iteration</span> <math id="algorithm1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bmod" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>mod</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bmod</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.5.6.6.5" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">Validation_Interval</span> <math id="algorithm1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=0</annotation></semantics></math></em><span id="algorithm1.5.6.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.5.6.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">then</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.5.7" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.5.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.5.7.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.5.7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.5.7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">5</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm1.5.7.5" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">k_reports</span><span id="algorithm1.5.7.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="algorithm1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.5.7.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="algorithm1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{tool\_evaluate}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐭𝐨𝐨𝐥</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐞𝐯𝐚𝐥𝐮𝐚𝐭𝐞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{tool\_evaluate}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.5.7.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><span id="algorithm1.5.7.9" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">k_designs</span><span id="algorithm1.5.7.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">)</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.5.8" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.5.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.5.8.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.5.8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.5.8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">6</span></span>
