 style="--ltx-fill-color:#800080;" class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r" fill="#800080" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 465.63 0) translate(3.26,0)"><path d="M 0 -1.97 M 0 -1.97 L 0 1.97 L 15.75 1.97 L 15.75 -1.97 Z M 15.75 1.97"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 484.92 0) translate(2.7,0) matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 3.04 -2.27)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:3.13em;--ltx-fo-height:0.6em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:7.97pt;" height="6.62" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 6.62)" width="34.52"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S3.F4.pic1.20" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">MACO</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 4</span>: </span><span id="S3.F4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Comparison of power efficiency (performance/power) across 8 kernels for different methods<span id="S3.F4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> – The evaluation compares MACO, MACO without software optimization, and other state-of-the-art LLM-based approaches for CGRA architecture generation. The most power-efficient CGRA design for each kernel is selected from 10 iterative runs and normalized against the results obtained from manual design.
</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
